WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:04.490
Two months passed since we started
our second year of high school.

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:06.480
Now that we had become

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.910
accustomed to our new classes
and to having juniors,

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:14.200
the biggest event of the year was upon us...
No, one of the biggest events in high school:

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:15.550
The school field trip.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.760
Here, Big Brother.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:19.180
Thanks, Kuzuha.

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:20.670
Well, I'm going to bed.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:21.930
'Night.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:32.420
And to me, that day is slightly
more significant than most.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:33.420
SCHOOL FIELD TRIP

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.020
Rikka, are you packed?

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.050
I'm opening the door.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.240
Ssh, they'll hear us.

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:51.000
It appears the dark followers
have not spotted us.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:52.900
But be careful.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:55.730
Any loud noises will annoy the neighbors.

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.030
Like you can talk!

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.510
What are you doing with these on, anyway?

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:04.000
I have just returned from my mission
to summon the Dark Flame Dragon.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.620
Wearing these fortifies
the Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:09.630
These are equipped with
the power to see isolated worlds.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:11.590
And they look cool.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:14.800
Just get packed.

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:21.560
So cool!

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:23.890
Just get packed and take your bath!

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:02.020
Travelling to the Island of
Tsukushi... of Hesitation

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:05.910
I can see you are fully prepared
for a journey to the dark world.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.830
That's a lot of luggage.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:11.250
This is actually less
than before. At first...

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.430
So, that's why this little bag smells so bad.

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:17.880
What? What do you mean by that?

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:20.380
Because it's "carrion" luggage.

00:03:22.060 --> 00:03:23.080
That's funny.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.560
How long are you going to keep doing that?

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:26.890
No go?

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:30.350
Gather round, everyone!

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:31.680
Let's get going.

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:34.610
Master, while you set out
for the battleground...

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:38.110
...I, Dekomori, will keep watch over
our society like a deity of protection!

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:39.440
I trust you.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:40.280
Time to go!

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:42.700
Dekomori!

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:44.410
Master!

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:44.890
See you later!

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.380
You're dressed sharp.

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:53.550
Of course I am. This is
the school field trip.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:56.270
Destiny could be waiting anywhere.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:04:01.480
I will now announce the recreation
programs for each group.

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:10.680
You are prohibited from
going to the other cars,

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.180
except to use the restroom.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:15.190
You are also prohibited
from using your cell phones.

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:17.940
The speed of sound is impressive!

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.590
We're not going quite that fast.

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:24.780
However, Wicked Lord Shingan sees all.
This is not a problem.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:32.330
She's not the girl who went
to her family home last year.

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:38.130
You guys sure do get along well.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:39.890
Don't take our photo!

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.880
Why not? You're going out, aren't you?

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:44.150
It's not like we're...

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:46.900
I won't go showing it to the other guys.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:48.710
I'll print it out for you later.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:04.050
Okay, I am giving you one hour of free time.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:05.650
Meet back here at 2 o'clock!

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:08.660
This place is amazing.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:11.470
The palace where the imprisoned
dragon's soul sleeps...

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.680
banished by the patron saint of darkness.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.670
Known as the Dark Dragonius Saint Palace!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.790
Don't name it!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:23.220
I will now infiltrate under
the dark followers' noses.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:27.350
You too!

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:33.520
We must always anticipate the
dark followers' attack.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.140
You brought that all this way just for that?

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.360
Full preparation at all times is key.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:39.900
You must really like those.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:42.070
I'm blinded!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.100
No duh!

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.440
Takanashi!

00:05:45.610 --> 00:05:47.240
What is that?

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.940
Combat equipment.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:50.450
As usual.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:54.370
Okay, I'll take a commemorative photo
of you and Togashi.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:54.800
Huh?

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.870
Don't be shy. This is a school field trip.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.330
Move closer together.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.500
Don't you want to make some
memories with your boyfriend?

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:02.390
B...

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:03.250
Boyfriend?

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.980
There you are, Togashi.

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:06.760
You have a copy
of the group schedule, right?

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.760
S-sure!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:09.860
Right here.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:10.800
Thanks.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:25.010
I'm bored.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.280
This is tedious.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:32.960
I must do something before
I lose mental capacity and die.

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:38.820
Can that be a messenger sent by my master?

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:42.120
I'm over here! Dekomori is over here!

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.270
Over here!

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:50.050
I thought I was gonna die.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.260
But Mr. Mushroom is such a fungi.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.160
You seem especially enthused about

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:58.560
napping ever since the
napping club competition.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:03.270
Wake up. Wake up now.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.670
Deko?

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:10.150
You have returned from the dream world!

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.720
What is it?

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:14.490
This region is stagnant territory!

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.660
We need to escape and
advance to another area!

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:18.910
Advance to where?

00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:22.330
Actually...

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:25.240
Oh, I know where to go.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:31.550
Yayoi Settlement
Museum

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.560
TODAY'S ACTIVITIES
Magatama making
Clay flute making

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:40.890
Historic ruins containing
the powers of darkness!

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.550
Isn't it amazing?

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:45.640
People lived in this area
from the Jomon period onward,

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.650
and there used to be a sea nearby.

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:49.850
I am fulfilled.

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:52.040
Takanashi, what are you doing?

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:55.400
Conversing with the souls
who once lived here so long ago.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.660
Wow, that's amazing. Nibu?

00:07:58.690 --> 00:08:00.010
I can hear them...

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:03.260
...the whispers of the Light Beings.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:05.400
What is your name?

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:07.350
What?

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:10.580
Himiko?

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:11.760
Nibu?

00:08:12.920 --> 00:08:16.160
Uh, it's nothing! Nothing at all!

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.310
Togashi!

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.640
Takanashi is here with us!

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:23.680
Uh, right.

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:27.400
Come on over, don't be
shy. Sorry about before!

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:29.570
I won't pester you anymore.

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.640
Right, Takanashi?

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.830
Huh? Takanashi?

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.420
This seems tricky.

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.140
You two are going out,

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:44.540
so there's no need
to be so embarrassed, is there?

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:48.460
I am bound to Yuta by a contract.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.550
But it's a Lover's Contract, isn't it?

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.050
Well...

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:59.160
Evil Eye Dark Curve!

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:02.180
Don't misbehave in a place like this!

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:05.060
Rikka!

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:12.280
Nibutani, what happened?

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:32.710
Each room's group must bathe
according to the schedule.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:38.220
So, you don't want her to get
worked up about romance?

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.690
Kind of.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.690
Here are the kimonos.

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:41.220
But you're going out.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:41.850
I'll wear my sweats.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.470
I forgot my shampoo!

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:46.980
Whenever she starts to think hard
about it, she gets confused.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:44.830
This place has shampoo.

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:46.980
It won't work.

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:51.910
The idea of romance doesn't
fit into her chunibyo delusion.

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:53.800
Then what are you gonna do?

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.200
Can you take care of her for now?

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:00.070
What?

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.620
Are you sure? Don't you want to be with her?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.880
I do, but so many people are watching us.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.130
Rikka can't handle that kind of thing.

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:17.380
You're actually kind of nice, you know?

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:18.960
What?

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.640
I'm nice?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:26.270
Exactly! What in the world
do those two want from me?!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.790
Wait, I'll do that.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:32.020
It's okay 'cause I just put these on.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.520
All-Porpoise

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.520
My "all-porpoise" socks.

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:34.810
Huh?

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:36.220
Never mind that!

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:38.780
We need to discuss the Dark
Flame Master and my master!

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:40.780
You're in a bad mood, Deko.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.830
Of course I am! I have
always showed restraint

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:46.540
whether they want to be together or not.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.850
Do they want to be together or don't they?

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:51.300
I know what you mean.
They're like that at home.

00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:51.920
Huh?

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:55.920
They're always so secretive.
It makes me feel like the villain.

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:59.060
I know! I know what you mean!

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:02.940
Little sister to Dark Flame Master
and Ghelzonianses!

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:04.940
Call me Kuzuha.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:07.680
You really love your big brother, don't you?

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.290
Not really.

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:12.690
I wonder how they're all doing?

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:14.500
What's this?

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:18.030
I forget.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:26.040
All
Porpoise

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:28.870
Hey, are you really going in there?

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:32.180
He's right. You should call it off.

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:34.960
Your opinion doesn't count
because you have Takanashi.

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:39.520
It's Isshiki! Isshiki's been captured!

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:40.630
Isshiki!

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:44.720
You're wrong! You've got it all wrong!

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:48.220
WOMEN'S
BATH

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:48.220
I honestly mixed up the men's
and the women's baths!

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:49.850
Isshiki...

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:51.640
Which means we use Route B?

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.930
We'd better hurry.

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:55.570
The girls in our class
will be done bathing soon.

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.780
Nibutani!

00:11:58.410 --> 00:11:59.780
Crush?

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:03.780
Don't you have a crush?
All the boys like you.

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:07.790
She's right. Aren't you
going out with anyone?

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:10.800
What? Uh, not anyone in particular.

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:12.830
Really? Is that true?

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.640
Then what about last year?

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:17.180
You had a boyfriend last year, didn't you?

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.550
Why the interrogation?

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:21.430
After all, just look.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:25.800
You've been good friends with Togashi
since you started high school.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:26.870
Huh?

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:30.450
Yeah. We thought maybe
you guys went out at some point.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:34.530
And then maybe you were in
a love triangle with Takanashi.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.360
What?!

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.440
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:43.630
From my personal viewpoint
as the Love Meister...

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:48.200
...you've never been in a relationship,
never mind a love triangle.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:48.950
Huh?

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:51.450
More girls are like that than you'd think.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:55.470
They look like seasoned veterans
when they're only amateurs.

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:56.460
No way!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.960
You have some experience, don't you?

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:01.700
Y-yes. In a way...

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.720
...you could say that.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:05.590
Really? When was this?

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:08.970
In middle school, I think.

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:11.120
Huh? But when you were in middle school...

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:13.980
didn't you go around saying
you were 1,200 years old?

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:18.150
Everyone was talking about it.
They say you still do it on the net.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:19.410
What do you mean?

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:20.910
We're too late.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:21.980
Nibutani!
We're too late.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:25.420
THE WHISPERS OF
MORI SUMMER
LOVE - LIFE - FORTUNE

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:23.090
See?

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:28.670
Horoscopes for the
12 Constellations

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:30.970
COMMENTS:
Mori Summer helped me with my love life.
I am happily dating my crush.
Mori Summer's advice did the trick!

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:33.450
That junior!

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:37.210
I see that look. So, it is you.

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:39.110
N-n-no, it isn't me!

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.770
I have nothing to do with it!

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.550
Why would I carry on like a Middle Two kid

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.630
now that I'm in high school?

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:47.010
C'mon, we have to be up early. Time to sleep!

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:17.370
And then a will 'o' the wisp
crept up beside the girl...

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.140
Stop it!

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:22.590
It's not that scary.

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:25.520
Yeah, forget the ghost stories.

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:28.020
I'd rather hear how far
you've gotten, Togashi.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:31.760
How far I've gotten with what?

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:35.480
You know. With Takanashi.

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:37.450
Like we really need to ask.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:40.530
You started going out during
last year's Culture Festival.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:41.770
How do you know that?

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:43.400
Yuta!

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.150
Rikka!

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:48.860
Stop that!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.380
A month later comes the kiss.

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:53.550
And then a few dates.

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:55.290
And then you spend Christmas Eve together.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.970
Die, fruitful offline life!
Shatter into a billion pieces!

00:14:57.970 --> 00:14:59.960
You're wrong! Don't reshape my love life!

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:01.580
Then when did you do it?

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:06.920
Uh, no. Like I'm saying.

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:12.050
W-we haven't yet.

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:15.310
What?!

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.950
Yeah, right.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:21.910
That's impossible. You're a healthy,
hot-blooded high school student!

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:24.960
Suffer in writhing agony and vanish,
fruitful offline life!

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:26.460
It's true!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:33.670
I gotta wonder why you feel
the need to lie at a time like this.

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:35.510
I'm telling you, I'm not lying!

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:37.540
All right, then bring Takanashi here.

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:39.660
How could I... do that?

00:15:40.050 --> 00:15:42.350
The teachers are patrolling the halls.

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:49.650
There! I just saw a strange
light in the window!

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:51.010
What?

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:59.360
I thought I just heard a woman moaning.

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.030
S-stop that.

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:02.530
Rest in peace, rest in peace, rest in peace.

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:03.600
I'll go have a look.

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:15.590
What're you doing? What if someone saw you?!

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:18.760
It's fine. My dark exorcizing
defensive application...

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:21.540
renders me visually
unrecognizable to commoners.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:22.330
See anything?

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:25.130
Uh, nothing worth mentioning.

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:27.600
So I was seeing things.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.860
Master, why don't you answer?

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.550
She'll be asleep by now.

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:39.450
Maybe she's with Dark Flame Master
at this moment.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:43.520
Don't worry. I doubt they're up to anything.

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:46.460
Hey, isn't that a girl's bag?

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.160
Still awake in there?

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:48.980
Oh, crap! It's the teacher!

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:06.850
Anyone still awake?

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:00.480
Sensei, can you please come here?

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:01.430
What is it?

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:05.130
I'm sorry, but I hear strange voices
from over there.

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:06.300
Show me.

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:11.400
We'd better go while you can.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:24.910
I'm sure I heard strange voices.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.300
Really? There's nobody there.

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:29.840
I think they came from further inside.

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:34.590
Go back to your room. You could be
sent home early if you're spotted.

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:38.250
Yeah.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:57.570
Yuta.

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:00.310
What is it?

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:09.120
There was a barrier between us.

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:12.520
I think it was the dark followers' doing.

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:16.960
A barrier that prevented me
from approaching you.

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:19.870
It was a form of psychological attack.

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:22.570
But I think I'm all right now.

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.640
I know.

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:30.140
I wasn't running from you.

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:33.560
And I wasn't avoiding you.

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:37.110
I get it.

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:40.950
You're trying to say you're too shy.

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:46.450
I am too.

00:19:48.590 --> 00:19:52.270
When we have free time tomorrow,
do you wanna look around together?

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:53.960
Just the two of us.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:00.360
Yeah.

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:04.860
Later, Rikka.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.010
Yeah.

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:25.440
Yuta!

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:55.440
Is it love, or is it something greater?

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:59.800
I don't know what it is yet,
but I had the feeling...

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:01.540
...that slowly but surely...

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:05.410
...that something was gradually
being set in motion.

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:10.330
I can't sleep.

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:14.090
Rikka and I greeted the new day.

00:21:15.100 --> 00:21:16.830
Hey, where's Takanashi?

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:19.420
She said she'll be doing her own thing.

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:28.030
What're you doing?

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:30.990
Lend me your power. We need to contain it.

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:33.490
What, that?

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:34.360
Yes.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:44.130
Begin!

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:59.690
Our day alone together begins!

00:22:02.570 --> 00:22:06.010
To be
Continued
